{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8c42d041-db0e-11ef-b17a-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8c42d031-db0e-11ef-93de-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":0,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"陝城","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"健","people_name_jianti_auto":"健","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a1f036bb-db0e-11ef-bc9b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"安","people_name_jianti_auto":"安","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"a1f036bc-db0e-11ef-bee8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"生","people_name_jianti_auto":"生","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"a1f036bd-db0e-11ef-8e8d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"蒲阪","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲阪","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"a1f036be-db0e-11ef-8e9a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"健臨沒，以安督中外諸軍，然尚在蒲阪，今生乃召之。","note_content_jianti_auto":"健临没，以安督中外诸军，然尚在蒲阪，今生乃召之。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"a1f036ba-db0e-11ef-99b7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"陝城","place_name_jianti_auto":"陕城","resolved_place_entity_id":1354,"start_index":78,"tongjian_id":"a1f036d0-db0e-11ef-a3e4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"13秦主生封衞大將軍黃眉爲廣平王，前將軍飛爲新興王，皆素所善也。徵大司馬武都王安領太尉。以晉王柳爲征東大將軍、幷州牧，鎭蒲阪；魏王廋爲鎭東大將軍、豫州牧，鎭陝城。","content_fanyi":"前秦主苻生将卫大将军苻黄眉封为广平王，将前将军苻飞封为新兴王，这二人素来为他所喜欢。随即征召大司马、武都王苻安兼领太尉。任命晋王苻柳出任征东大将军、并州牧，镇守蒲阪；任命魏王苻廋出任镇东大将军、豫州牧，镇守陕城。","content_jianti_auto":"13秦主生封衞大将军黄眉为广平王，前将军飞为新兴王，皆素所善也。征大司马武都王安领太尉。以晋王柳为征东大将军、幷州牧，镇蒲阪；魏王廋为镇东大将军、豫州牧，镇陕城。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":8682,"number":13,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百 (晉紀二十二) / 孝宗穆皇帝中之下 / 永和十一年 / 第 15 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"a1f036b9-db0e-11ef-b563-a0d3651f611f","year_int":355},"tongjian_id":"a1f036b9-db0e-11ef-b563-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"陝城","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"崤","place_name_jianti_auto":"崤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a2504f25-db0e-11ef-9078-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"崤谷","place_name_jianti_auto":"崤谷","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"a2504f26-db0e-11ef-8565-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"澠","place_name_jianti_auto":"渑","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"a2504f27-db0e-11ef-8034-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"澠池","place_name_jianti_auto":"渑池","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"a2504f28-db0e-11ef-96ee-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"崤，崤谷也；澠，澠池也。澠，彌兗翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"崤，崤谷也；渑，渑池也。渑，弥兖翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"a2504f24-db0e-11ef-bf66-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"陝城","place_name_jianti_auto":"陕城","resolved_place_entity_id":1354,"start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"a2504f30-db0e-11ef-9799-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/三、晋 十六国（卷三）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"，东至泗上，南至宛城，皆为燕境[太和元年，燕取鲁、高平诸...","context_before":"...兼陈、汝[兴宁二年，燕将李洪等复攻取许昌及汝南、陈郡]，","source_end_index":1020,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"1cb48bc4-3d2c-5e61-af63-c13b19cd5c8e","source_start_index":990,"source_text":"取洛阳[三年，慕容恪取洛阳，略地至崤、渑，秦人屯陕城以备之]"}],"path":"历代州域形势纪要/三、晋 十六国（卷三）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷四十六）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"义熙十三年，刘裕伐秦，檀道济等由许、洛军渑池，进攻潼关。...","context_before":"...。刘曜使其党刘岳趣孟津，呼延谟自崤黾而东，合诸军攻洛阳。","source_end_index":962,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"57821882-d778-5047-9de3-56798ab24ffe","source_start_index":926,"source_text":"兴宁三年，燕慕容恪陷洛阳，略地至崤黾，关中大震。秦苻坚自将屯陕城以备之。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷四十六）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"恪略地至崤、澠，關中大震，秦王堅自將屯陝城以備之。","content_fanyi":"慕容恪攻取土地，一直推进到崤山、渑池，关中地区大为震动，前秦王苻坚亲自率领军队驻守陕城，以抵御慕容恪。","content_jianti_auto":"恪略地至崤、渑，关中大震，秦王坚自将屯陕城以备之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":8873,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百一 (晉紀二十三) / 哀皇帝 / 三年 / 第 9 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"a2504f23-db0e-11ef-822b-a0d3651f611f","year_int":365},"tongjian_id":"a2504f23-db0e-11ef-822b-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"陝城","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"廋","people_name_jianti_auto":"廋","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"a25b4497-db0e-11ef-98a9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"武","people_name_jianti_auto":"武","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"a25b4498-db0e-11ef-8825-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"健","people_name_jianti_auto":"健","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"a25b4499-db0e-11ef-8b62-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"a25b449a-db0e-11ef-9bc7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"幷州","place_name_jianti_auto":"幷州","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"a25b449b-db0e-11ef-aef9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蒲阪","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲阪","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"a25b449c-db0e-11ef-8ad9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦州","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦州","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"a25b449d-db0e-11ef-8657-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"上邽","place_name_jianti_auto":"上邽","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"a25b449e-db0e-11ef-9373-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"洛州","place_name_jianti_auto":"洛州","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"a25b449f-db0e-11ef-aa24-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"陝","place_name_jianti_auto":"陕","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"a25b44a0-db0e-11ef-8bf4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"雍州","place_name_jianti_auto":"雍州","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"a25b44a1-db0e-11ef-bffd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"安定","place_name_jianti_auto":"安定","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"a25b44a2-db0e-11ef-b63e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"復，扶又翻。秦幷州刺史治蒲阪，秦州刺史治上邽，洛州刺史治陝，雍州刺史治安定。廋、武，皆健子也。廋，疏鳩翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"复，扶又翻。秦幷州刺史治蒲阪，秦州刺史治上邽，洛州刺史治陕，雍州刺史治安定。廋、武，皆健子也。廋，疏鸠翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":102,"tongjian_id":"a25b4496-db0e-11ef-877e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"王猛","people_name_jianti_auto":"王猛","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"a25b44a6-db0e-11ef-9718-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"果如王猛之言。","note_content_jianti_auto":"果如王猛之言。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":192,"tongjian_id":"a25b44a5-db0e-11ef-ab6c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"柳","people_name_jianti_auto":"柳","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"a25b44a8-db0e-11ef-b002-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"棃肉脆而齧之易入，以喻親戚離叛，則國力脆弱，將爲敵人所乘，故齧棃付使者，賜柳等以爲信也。使，疏吏翻。齧，魚結翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"棃肉脆而啮之易入，以喻亲戚离叛，则国力脆弱，将为敌人所乘，故啮棃付使者，赐柳等以为信也。使，疏吏翻。啮，鱼结翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":247,"tongjian_id":"a25b44a7-db0e-11ef-8f60-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"a25b4495-db0e-11ef-b71a-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"sōu","source_anchor_text":"刺史魏公廋安西將軍","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":84,"text":"廋","tongjian_id":"7b3664e8-96c1-5841-b650-901b3e4deb9c"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"a25b4495-db0e-11ef-b71a-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"niè","source_anchor_text":"切如故各齧梨以為信","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":237,"text":"齧","tongjian_id":"4bdf4cf8-5fe5-5caf-b464-52ad3c947ce4"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"陝城","place_name_jianti_auto":"陕城","resolved_place_entity_id":1354,"start_index":179,"tongjian_id":"a25b44cd-db0e-11ef-82d3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"10秦淮南公幼之反也，征東大將軍、幷州牧、晉公柳，征西大將軍、秦州刺史趙公雙，皆與之通謀；秦王堅以雙，母弟至親，柳，健之愛子，隱而不問。柳、雙復與鎭東將軍、洛州刺史魏公廋，安西將軍、雍州刺史燕公武謀作亂，鎭東主簿南安姚眺諫曰：「明公以周、邵之親，受方面之任，國家有難，當竭力除之，況自爲難乎！」廋不聽。堅聞之，徵柳等詣長安。冬，十月，柳據蒲阪，雙據上邽，廋據陝城，武據安定，皆舉兵反。堅遣使諭之曰：「吾待卿等，恩亦至矣，何苦而反！今止不徵，卿宜罷兵，各定其位，一切如故。」各齧棃以爲信。皆不從。","content_fanyi":"前秦淮南公苻幼反叛的时候，征东大将军、并州牧、晋公苻柳，征西大将军、秦州刺史赵公苻双，都与他合谋；前秦王苻坚因为苻双是同母的至亲弟弟，苻柳是苻健的爱子，便隐瞒下来，不加追究。苻柳、苻双又同镇东将军、洛州刺史魏公苻廋，安西将军、雍州刺史燕公苻武谋划作乱，镇东主簿、南安人姚眺劝谏苻廋说：“明公凭着周公、召公那样的宗室至亲，承担一方的重任，国家有难，应当竭力消除祸难，何况自己制造祸难呢！”苻廋不听。苻坚听说后，征召苻柳等人前往长安。冬季，十月，苻柳占据蒲阪，苻双占据上邽，苻廋占据陕城，苻武占据安定，都举兵反叛。苻坚派使者晓谕他们说：“我对待你们，恩义已经到极点了，何苦要反叛！现在停止征召你们，你们应当罢兵，各自安定本位，一切照旧。”又让他们各自咬梨交给使者作为信物。他们都不听从。","content_jianti_auto":"10秦淮南公幼之反也，征东大将军、幷州牧、晋公柳，征西大将军、秦州刺史赵公双，皆与之通谋；秦王坚以双，母弟至亲，柳，健之爱子，隐而不问。柳、双复与镇东将军、洛州刺史魏公廋，安西将军、雍州刺史燕公武谋作乱，镇东主簿南安姚眺谏曰：「明公以周、邵之亲，受方面之任，国家有难，当竭力除之，况自为难乎！」廋不听。坚闻之，征柳等诣长安。冬，十月，柳据蒲阪，双据上邽，廋据陕城，武据安定，皆举兵反。坚遣使谕之曰：「吾待卿等，恩亦至矣，何苦而反！今止不征，卿宜罢兵，各定其位，一切如故。」各啮棃以为信。皆不从。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":8919,"number":10,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百一 (晉紀二十三) / 海西公上 / 二年 / 第 16 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"a25b4495-db0e-11ef-b71a-a0d3651f611f","year_int":367},"tongjian_id":"a25b4495-db0e-11ef-b71a-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":3},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"陝城","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"陝城","place_name_jianti_auto":"陕城","resolved_place_entity_id":1354,"start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"a25d964f-db0e-11ef-997c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"1春，正月，秦王堅遣後將軍楊成世、左將軍毛嵩分討上邽、安定，輔國將軍王猛、建節將軍鄧羌攻蒲阪，前將軍楊安、廣武將軍張蚝攻陝城。堅命蒲、陝之軍皆距城三十里，堅壁勿戰，俟秦、雍已平，然後幷力取之。","content_fanyi":"春季，正月，前秦主苻坚派后将军杨成世、左将军毛嵩分头讨伐上邽、安定，派辅国将军王猛、建节将军邓羌攻打蒲阪，又派前将军杨安、广武将军张蚝攻打陕城。苻坚命令派往蒲阪、陕城的军队都到距离城池三十里处构筑坚固壁垒，避免与敌军交战，等到秦州、雍州平定以后，再集中兵力攻取。","content_jianti_auto":"1春，正月，秦王坚遣后将军杨成世、左将军毛嵩分讨上邽、安定，辅国将军王猛、建节将军邓羌攻蒲阪，前将军杨安、广武将军张蚝攻陕城。坚命蒲、陕之军皆距城三十里，坚壁勿战，俟秦、雍已平，然后幷力取之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":8922,"number":1,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百一 (晉紀二十三) / 海西公上 / 三年 / 第 1 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a25d7b0a-db0e-11ef-939f-a0d3651f611f","year_int":368},"tongjian_id":"a25d7b0a-db0e-11ef-939f-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":4},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"陝城","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"華陰縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"华阴县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a25d9673-db0e-11ef-8285-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"陝城","place_name_jianti_auto":"陕城","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"a25d9674-db0e-11ef-818c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"潼關","place_name_jianti_auto":"潼关","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"a25d9675-db0e-11ef-8de9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"華陰縣在陝城之西，有潼關之險。降，戶江翻。華，戶化翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"华阴县在陕城之西，有潼关之险。降，户江翻。华，户化翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"a25d9672-db0e-11ef-a26f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"陝城","place_name_jianti_auto":"陕城","resolved_place_entity_id":1354,"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"a25d9679-db0e-11ef-b25d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"3秦魏公廋以陝城降燕，請兵應接；秦人大懼，盛兵守華陰。","content_fanyi":"前秦魏公苻廋以陕城投降前燕，并请求前燕发兵接应；前秦人十分恐惧，部署重兵守卫华阴。","content_jianti_auto":"3秦魏公廋以陕城降燕，请兵应接；秦人大惧，盛兵守华阴。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":8924,"number":3,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百一 (晉紀二十三) / 海西公上 / 三年 / 第 3 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"a25d9671-db0e-11ef-bab1-a0d3651f611f","year_int":368},"tongjian_id":"a25d9671-db0e-11ef-bab1-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":5},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"陝城","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"陝城","place_name_jianti_auto":"陕城","resolved_place_entity_id":1354,"start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"a25fec36-db0e-11ef-97cf-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"九月，王猛等拔蒲阪，斬晉公柳及其妻子。猛屯蒲阪，遣鄧羌與王鑒等會攻陝城。","content_fanyi":"九月，王猛等人攻克蒲阪，斩杀晋公苻柳及其妻子儿女。王猛驻扎在蒲阪，派遣邓羌与王鉴等会合攻打陕城。","content_jianti_auto":"九月，王猛等拔蒲阪，斩晋公柳及其妻子。猛屯蒲阪，遣邓羌与王鉴等会攻陕城。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":8932,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百一 (晉紀二十三) / 海西公上 / 三年 / 第 11 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"a25fec2d-db0e-11ef-af42-a0d3651f611f","year_int":368},"tongjian_id":"a25fec2d-db0e-11ef-af42-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":6},{"mention_count":2,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"陝城","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"苻健","people_name_jianti_auto":"苻健","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a25fec4e-db0e-11ef-b42c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"高祖","people_name_jianti_auto":"高祖","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"a25fec4f-db0e-11ef-95b0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"苻健廟號高祖。","note_content_jianti_auto":"苻健庙号高祖。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":88,"tongjian_id":"a25fec4d-db0e-11ef-b6cc-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"苻生","people_name_jianti_auto":"苻生","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a25fec51-db0e-11ef-848a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"越王","people_name_jianti_auto":"越王","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"a25fec52-db0e-11ef-8fa9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"厲","people_name_jianti_auto":"厉","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"a25fec53-db0e-11ef-8b46-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"苻生廢爲越王，諡曰厲。","note_content_jianti_auto":"苻生废为越王，谥曰厉。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":125,"tongjian_id":"a25fec50-db0e-11ef-b0d6-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"苻雙","people_name_jianti_auto":"苻双","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a25fec55-db0e-11ef-866b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"仲羣","people_name_jianti_auto":"仲群","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"a25fec56-db0e-11ef-9ec3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"苻雙，字仲羣。","note_content_jianti_auto":"苻双，字仲群。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":187,"tongjian_id":"a25fec54-db0e-11ef-a805-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"陝城","place_name_jianti_auto":"陕城","resolved_place_entity_id":1354,"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"a25fec5f-db0e-11ef-8a19-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"陝城","place_name_jianti_auto":"陕城","resolved_place_entity_id":1354,"start_index":233,"tongjian_id":"a25fec73-db0e-11ef-b998-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"8十二月，秦王猛等拔陝城，獲魏公廋，送長安。秦王堅問其所以反，對曰：「臣本無反心，但以弟兄屢謀逆亂，臣懼幷死，故謀反耳。」堅泣曰：「汝素長者，固知非汝心也；且高祖不可以無後。」乃賜廋死，原其七子，以長子襲魏公，餘子皆封縣公，以嗣越厲王及諸弟之無後者。苟太后曰：「廋與雙俱反，雙獨不得置後，何也？」堅曰：「天下者，高祖之天下，高祖之子不可以無後。至於仲羣，不顧太后，謀危宗廟，天下之法，不可私也！」以范陽公抑爲征東大將軍、幷州刺史，鎭蒲阪；鄧羌爲建武將軍、洛州刺史，鎭陝城。擢姚眺爲汲郡太守。","content_fanyi":"十二月，前秦王猛等人攻克陕城，俘获魏公苻廋，送往长安。前秦王苻坚问他反叛的原因，苻廋回答说：“臣本来没有反叛之心，只因兄弟几个屡次图谋作乱，我害怕被一同处死，所以才谋反。”苻坚流着泪说：“你一向是忠厚长者，我本来就知道这不是你的本意；况且高祖苻健不能没有后嗣。”于是赐苻廋死，宽恕他的七个儿子，让他的长子继承魏公，其余儿子都封为县公，以接续越厉王苻生以及众位弟弟中没有后嗣者的香火。苟太后说：“苻廋和苻双一同造反，为什么唯独苻双不能立后？”苻坚说：“天下是高祖的天下，高祖的儿子不能没有后嗣。至于仲群，也就是苻双，他不顾太后，图谋危害宗庙，国法不能徇私！”任命范阳公苻抑为征东大将军、并州刺史，镇守蒲阪；任命邓羌为建武将军、洛州刺史，镇守陕城。提拔姚眺为汲郡太守。","content_jianti_auto":"8十二月，秦王猛等拔陕城，获魏公廋，送长安。秦王坚问其所以反，对曰：「臣本无反心，但以弟兄屡谋逆乱，臣惧幷死，故谋反耳。」坚泣曰：「汝素长者，固知非汝心也；且高祖不可以无后。」乃赐廋死，原其七子，以长子袭魏公，余子皆封县公，以嗣越厉王及诸弟之无后者。苟太后曰：「廋与双俱反，双独不得置后，何也？」坚曰：「天下者，高祖之天下，高祖之子不可以无后。至于仲群，不顾太后，谋危宗庙，天下之法，不可私也！」以范阳公抑为征东大将军、幷州刺史，镇蒲阪；邓羌为建武将军、洛州刺史，镇陕城。擢姚眺为汲郡太守。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":8934,"number":8,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百一 (晉紀二十三) / 海西公上 / 三年 / 第 13 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"a25fec4c-db0e-11ef-911d-a0d3651f611f","year_int":368},"tongjian_id":"a25fec4c-db0e-11ef-911d-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":7},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"陝城","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"猛","people_name_jianti_auto":"猛","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a2834ed3-db0e-11ef-8a76-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"寅","people_name_jianti_auto":"寅","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"a2834ed4-db0e-11ef-b36f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"猛爲輔國將軍，以寅爲司馬。","note_content_jianti_auto":"猛为辅国将军，以寅为司马。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"a2834ed2-db0e-11ef-a9bc-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"鄧羌","people_name_jianti_auto":"邓羌","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"a2834ed6-db0e-11ef-8af5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"桓寅","people_name_jianti_auto":"桓寅","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"a2834ed7-db0e-11ef-96c8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a2834ed8-db0e-11ef-9725-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"洛州","place_name_jianti_auto":"洛州","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"a2834ed9-db0e-11ef-afef-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"陝","place_name_jianti_auto":"陕","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"a2834eda-db0e-11ef-88ad-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"金墉","place_name_jianti_auto":"金墉","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"a2834edb-db0e-11ef-8e28-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"陝","place_name_jianti_auto":"陕","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"a2834edc-db0e-11ef-912e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"秦初以洛州刺史鎭陝；今鄧羌旣進屯金墉，故以桓寅代戍陝。陝，失冉翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"秦初以洛州刺史镇陕；今邓羌既进屯金墉，故以桓寅代戍陕。陕，失冉翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"a2834ed5-db0e-11ef-afe1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"陝城","place_name_jianti_auto":"陕城","resolved_place_entity_id":1354,"start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"a2834ee9-db0e-11ef-9d57-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"自后燕至姚秦皆为重地。义熙十三年，刘裕伐秦，取荥阳。其后...","context_before":"...荥阳，前救金墉。永和末，荥阳复归于晋。隆和初，为燕所陷。","source_end_index":508,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"103441e8-113a-55a8-868f-416ff6ae8397","source_start_index":474,"source_text":"太和五年，秦王猛取洛阳，燕慕容臧自石门进屯荥阳，猛遣将梁成等击走之。"},{"context_after":"太元九年，复归晋。隆安初，姚兴遣姚崇寇洛阳，河南太守夏侯...","context_before":"...屯故太极殿前，寻徙屯金墉，置戍而还。兴宁二年，为燕所陷。","source_end_index":276,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"2eefa106-9bee-5cd6-aee2-390e57139a5a","source_start_index":257,"source_text":"太和五年，秦王猛克洛阳，使邓羌戍金墉。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、河南府（卷四十八）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"太元九年，复归晋。隆安初，姚兴遣姚崇寇洛阳，河南太守夏侯...","context_before":"...屯故太极殿前，寻徙屯金墉，置戍而还。兴宁二年，为燕所陷。","source_end_index":276,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"4b4c8807-d301-51ba-9ce5-1fd8de43d9c6","source_start_index":257,"source_text":"太和五年，秦王猛克洛阳，使邓羌戍金墉。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/二、河南府（卷四十八）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"3樂安王臧進屯滎陽，王猛遣建威將軍梁成、洛州刺史鄧羌擊走之；留羌鎭金墉，以輔國司馬桓寅爲弘農太守，代羌戍陝城而還。","content_fanyi":"前燕乐安王慕容臧率兵进屯荥阳，王猛派建威将军梁成、洛州刺史邓羌将他击退；留下邓羌镇守金墉，任命辅国司马桓寅为弘农太守，接替邓羌戍守陕城，随后王猛返回。","content_jianti_auto":"3乐安王臧进屯荥阳，王猛遣建威将军梁成、洛州刺史邓羌击走之；留羌镇金墉，以辅国司马桓寅为弘农太守，代羌戍陕城而还。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":8973,"number":3,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百二 (晉紀二十四) / 海西公下 / 五年 / 第 5 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"a2834ed1-db0e-11ef-9055-a0d3651f611f","year_int":370},"tongjian_id":"a2834ed1-db0e-11ef-9055-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":8},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"陝城","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"陝城","place_name_jianti_auto":"陕城","resolved_place_entity_id":1354,"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"a3303c51-db0e-11ef-ae8f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"28秦平原公暉帥洛陽、陝城之衆七萬歸于長安。","content_fanyi":"前秦平原公苻晖统率洛阳、陕城的七万士兵返回长安。","content_jianti_auto":"28秦平原公晖帅洛阳、陕城之众七万归于长安。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":9283,"number":28,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百五 (晉紀二十七) / 烈宗孝武皇帝上之下 / 九年 / 第 36 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"a3303c4b-db0e-11ef-abcb-a0d3651f611f","year_int":384},"tongjian_id":"a3303c4b-db0e-11ef-abcb-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":9},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"陝城","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"explicit_reference","source_end_index":19,"source_start_index":7,"source_text":